FROM golang:1.26 AS builder
ARG TARGETOS
ARG TARGETARCH
WORKDIR /workspace
COPY go.mod go.sum ./
RUN go mod download
COPY . .
RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=${TARGETOS:-linux} GOARCH=${TARGETARCH} \
    go build -trimpath -ldflags="-s -w" -o factory-api ./cmd/factory-api

FROM gcr.io/distroless/static:nonroot
WORKDIR /
COPY --from=builder /workspace/factory-api .
USER 65532:65532
EXPOSE 8081
ENTRYPOINT ["/factory-api"]
